            "desc": "\u003Cp\u003EWe're a software development agency based in Karachi working across multiple client projects. We're looking for a mid-level full-stack developer who can work independently, deliver quality, and thrive in a fast-paced agency environment.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EResponsibilities:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Build and maintain full-stack web applications (React/Next.js + Node.js/Express)\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Work across multiple client projects simultaneously\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Design and optimize databases (MongoDB / PostgreSQL)\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Write clean, tested, production-ready TypeScript code\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Review AI-generated code for correctness and security\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Help unblock and mentor junior developers\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Set up and maintain CI/CD pipelines and Docker environments\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhat we expect:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- 80-90% independence — minimal hand-holding\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Test before every commit (desktop + mobile)\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Proactive communication — escalate blockers, don't go silent\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E- Ownership mentality — you drive tasks to completion\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGrowth path: E1 → E2 → E3 (Senior/Lead). Mentorship from a 10+ year senior developer.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInterested candidates must apply using the form below — no DMs or emails accepted:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/8js3LFVVtgFKDr4cA\u003C/p\u003E",
